<title>USA: Video Display Corp Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>Video Display Corp Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>VIDEO DISPLAY CORPORATION</p>
<p>						  Three Months Ended,</p>
<p>					  Aug 31, 1996     Aug 31, 1995</p>
<p> Net Sales			     $12,961,000	$11,492,000</p>
<p> Operating Profit			1,389,000	    915,000</p>
<p> Net Income				  752,000	    365,000</p>
<p> Net Income Per Share			 0.18		 0.09</p>
<p>Weighted Average Shares Outstanding</p>
<p>					     3,986,000	  4,017,000</p>
<p>						  Six Months Ended,</p>
<p>					  Aug 31, 1996     Aug 31, 1995</p>
<p> Net Sales				25,059,000	 23,443,000</p>
<p> Operating Profit			2,375,000	  2,008,000</p>
<p> Net Income				1,206,000	    962,000</p>
<p> Net Income Per Share			 0.30		 0.24</p>
<p>Weighted Average Shares Outstanding</p>
<p>					     3,986,000	  4,017,000</p>
<p>NOTE:  Results are unaudited and subject to adjustment.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
